program	errors/nomove_requires_nocopy.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`Loose` declares `NoMove` without declaring `NoCopy`: relocation and duplication are separate properties, and `NoMove` requires the other to be stated rather than implying it
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `Loose` declares `NoMove` without declaring `NoCopy`: relocation and duplication are separate properties, and `NoMove` requires the other to be stated rather than implying it"
log	"  --> examples/errors/nomove_requires_nocopy.saw:15:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 | struct Loose {"
log	"     | ^"
log	"   hint: add `extension Loose: NoCopy {}` beside the `NoMove` conformance — a value that may not move and may be freely duplicated is not a shape v1 supports"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
